# game/ep2d7.rpy:888
translate chinese ep2d7_510ff52d:

    # a ramble "{cps=120}I’m sorry, Marina. I’m sorry I’ve made you feel \nlike you’re a bad person. You’re not a bad \nperson at all, please, don’t think that, Marina."
    a ramble "{cps=120}对不起，玛琳娜。对不起我让你觉得自己\n是个坏人。你完全不是坏人，请不要那样想，玛琳娜。{w=0.2}{size=-8}{color=#999999} {cps=120}I’m sorry, Marina. I’m sorry I’ve made you feel \nlike you’re a bad person. You’re not a bad \nperson at all, please, don’t think that, Marina.{/color}{/size}"

# game/ep2d7.rpy:889
translate chinese ep2d7_37896917:

    # a "{cps=140}Please, I really think you’re amazing, I’m so \nhappy you talked to me. I don’t care if I’m a \ndistraction, I don’t mind, I really don’t mind. \nJust talking to someone so nice made me so happy."
    a "{cps=140}求你了，我真的觉得你很棒，你能来找我说话我\n特别开心。就算我是个消遣也没关系，我不介意，真的\n不介意。光是和一个那么好的人说话，就已经让我那么幸福了。{w=0.2}{size=-8}{color=#999999} {cps=140}Please, I really think you’re amazing, I’m so \nhappy you talked to me. I don’t care if I’m a \ndistraction, I don’t mind, I really don’t mind. \nJust talking to someone so nice made me so happy.{/color}{/size}"

# game/ep2d7.rpy:895
translate chinese ep2d7_abf024a8:

    # a "{cps=160}Please, Marina, please forgive me. I’ve made \nyou feel so bad, I’m sorry, I’m really sorry. \nBut I really-"
    a "{cps=160}求你了玛琳娜，求你原谅我。我让你\n那么难受，对不起，真的很对不起。\n可是我真的——{w=0.2}{size=-8}{color=#999999} {cps=160}Please, Marina, please forgive me. I’ve made \nyou feel so bad, I’m sorry, I’m really sorry. \nBut I really-{/color}{/size}"

# game/ep2d7.rpy:901
translate chinese ep2d7_8f80f7bc:

    # a "{cps=180}Ah, Marina, I’m sorry, please, please, don’t be \nmad at me. Don’t be disgusted with me. You can \nlaugh at me, but please, don’t be mad."
    a "{cps=180}啊，玛琳娜，对不起，求你了，求你了，别生\n我的气。别讨厌我。你可以\n笑话我，但求你了，别生气。{w=0.2}{size=-8}{color=#999999} {cps=180}Ah, Marina, I’m sorry, please, please, don’t be \nmad at me. Don’t be disgusted with me. You can \nlaugh at me, but please, don’t be mad.{/color}{/size}"

# game/ep2d7.rpy:907
translate chinese ep2d7_6da9825d:

    # a "{cps=200}I'm sorry if I've ever been gross or awkward, I \ndidn't mean to be, I didn't mean to be \nembarrassing. I'm sorry if I didn't talk right, I \nshould know how to do it by now, it's my fault."
    a "{cps=200}如果我一直以来的样子又恶心又尴尬，对不起，我\n不是故意的，我不是故意让人难堪的。如果我说话不得体，\n对不起，事到如今我早该学会怎么说话了，都怪我。{w=0.2}{size=-8}{color=#999999} {cps=200}I'm sorry if I've ever been gross or awkward, I \ndidn't mean to be, I didn't mean to be \nembarrassing. I'm sorry if I didn't talk right, I \nshould know how to do it by now, it's my fault.{/color}{/size}"

# game/ep2d7.rpy:908
translate chinese ep2d7_6569f9f6:

    # a "{cps=200}But I'll learn everything, I'll learn how to \ntalk. I'll learn how to be fun. I'll learn how \nto be pretty. I won't make you look bad for \ntalking to me. I promise, Marina!"
    a "{cps=200}但我会学好的，我会学会\n说话。我会学会有趣。我会学会\n漂亮。我不会让你因为跟我说话而丢脸。\n我保证，玛琳娜！{w=0.2}{size=-8}{color=#999999} {cps=200}But I'll learn everything, I'll learn how to \ntalk. I'll learn how to be fun. I'll learn how \nto be pretty. I won't make you look bad for \ntalking to me. I promise, Marina!{/color}{/size}"

